        (:func:`~torch.fft.rfft2`), these correspond to:

        * ``"forward"`` - normalize by ``1/n``
        * ``"backward"`` - no normalization
        * ``"ortho"`` - normalize by ``1/sqrt(n)`` (making the real FFT orthonormal)

