RuntimeError: rfftn expects a complex output tensor, but got Double
RuntimeError: Unsupported dtype Half
RuntimeError: When given, dim and shape arguments must have the same length
RuntimeError: FFT dims must be unique
TypeError: fft_rfft2(): argument 'out' must be Tensor, not float
